  "description": "Ye-Jin, a smart girl from a poor family who gets into a top university, has zero dating experience. Now that she's in college, she wants to find love, so she puts herself out there, but... Enter Hyeon, an elite Taekwondo athlete, her only guy friend from childhood, who masquerades as her \"bestie,\" but is he really? Ye-Jin is determined to support her family through academic achievement, but she also wants love. Can she have both? How will Ye-Jin navigate the journey of having it all? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes seven extra chapters.*",
